{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_chat_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "048a3dbe47e857da2fe6b6ee9570cb113d66d1b37c3b27e6e739f66ea79df1aa", "ja": "うーん……\n最近、同じ夢ばっかり\n見るんだよね。不思議～。", "zh": "嗯……\n最近总是做同一个梦呢。真奇怪～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_chat_1001_102mis", "source_sha256": "28491cde8ae2bac2722ddeca57fd0443b5dde3b67d8d0807a4383cc0c02b49f2", "ja": "夢の中でも私、衣装を作ってて。\nそれはもう、素晴らしい\n衣装なんだけど……", "zh": "在梦里我也在做服装。\n而且做得非常出色，\n可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_chat_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "782dafc9036cefcdf4f4d5ae384555b528c755e964a1de5dbc4508db77daff9a", "ja": "もうすぐ完成だー！　って\n思ったところで、いつも\n目が覚めちゃって。", "zh": "正想着“马上就要完成了——！”\n的时候，却总会\n醒过来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0418_story_chat_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0418_story_chat_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "70161fbe5b18ea0168557dbcbc668e70422cd027b65690226e8983e212d7d575", "ja": "毎回同じ衣装を作ってるのに\nいつまでも完成しないから……\nうう、モヤモヤする～！", "zh": "明明每次都在做同一套服装，却总是一直完成不了……呜呜，好烦闷啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
